{"ref":"BDB, הָשֵׁם","hw":"הָשֵׁם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">הָשֵׁם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> father of one (or more?) of David’s heroes <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.34\">1 Ch 11:34</a>, but read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָשֵׁן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:32\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.32\">2 S 23:32</a> and del. <span dir=\"rtl\">בני</span>; cf. Dr<sup>Sm</sup> and v. further sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, יָשֵׁן\" href=\"/BDB,_יָשֵׁן\", dir=\"rtl\">יָשֵׁן</a>.","next":"BDB, הַשְׁמָעוּת","prev":"BDB, הֲרָרִי"}